      "type": "open_ended",
      "question": "How has the legal framework governing industrial duty concessions in Bangladesh shifted from 2010 to 2024?",
      "answer": "The legal basis for industrial concessions transitioned from the Customs Act 1969, as seen in instruments like SRO 176/2010, to the Customs Act 2023 framework, formalized by SRO 164/2024. This shift reflects a broader evolution in the regulatory environment, moving from older legislative structures to the updated 2023 Act to govern modern industrial duty exemptions.",
